; The upstream of every server compared (compare.sh): a root zone whose wildcard answers any name, as the stub
; upstream of TelltaleDNS's bench does, so that no query of the corpora fails upstream. Signed by Knot for `dnssec`.
$ORIGIN .
$TTL 3600
@         SOA   ns.bench. hostmaster.bench. 1 3600 900 604800 3600
@         NS    ns.bench.
ns.bench. A     127.0.0.1
*         A     198.18.0.1
*         AAAA  2001:2::1
